        "type": "text",
        "text": "{\"recorded_count\": 22, \"total_count\": 22, \"missing_ids\": [], \"complete\": true, \"results\": [{\"item_id\": \"FT-1\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created \\\"Test Gadget XYZ\\\" via admin (name, price $123, rating 4.2, image, affiliate link, tags, description, review, spec, category Fitness, featured). Edited existing product (Philips Hue) name/tags. Both immediately reflected in /products list, /category/fitness, and /product/{slug} detail view without reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-2\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Featured \\\"View all\\\" is broken; visitors cannot browse the complete set of featured products\", \"actual\": \"Homepage featured section shows only a 3-item preview. Marking/unmarking a product as featured correctly updates that preview (e.g., unmarking Sony removed it, leaving 2 items). However clicking \\\"View all\\\" on the Featured section navigates to /products?featured=true, which does NOT filter by featured - it shows all 10-11 products instead of only featured ones. No advanced filter option for \\\"featured\\\" exists either, and no dedicated /featured route exists (404-style error). So there is no way for a visitor to browse the complete set of featured products.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-3\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Search \\\"SONY\\\" (uppercase) matched name case-insensitively (1 result). Search \\\"noise-cancelling\\\" matched tag (1 result). Search \\\"espresso\\\" matched brief description (1 result). Count label accurate in all cases.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-4\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Tag filter choice list is static and does not update when a product's tags change\", \"actual\": \"Created a new product with tags \\\"newtagone, newtagtwo\\\" and edited an existing product's tags (removed ambiance/automation/smart-home, renamed smart-home to smart-home-renamed, added colorful/newaddedtag). The tags appeared correctly on the product detail pages and were searchable, but the Tags filter chip list on /products still shows only the original 35 seeded tag values (still includes now-unused \\\"ambiance\\\", \\\"automation\\\", \\\"smart-home\\\") and never gained \\\"newtagone\\\", \\\"newtagtwo\\\", \\\"smart-home-renamed\\\", \\\"colorful\\\", or \\\"newaddedtag\\\" as selectable filter chips.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created product with new tags \\\"newtagone, newtagtwo\\\"; both appeared on the product detail page's tag list and keyword search for \\\"newtagone\\\" returned that product (1 result).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Edited Philips Hue Starter Kit tags from \\\"lighting, smart-home, ambiance, automation\\\" to \\\"lighting, smart-home-renamed, colorful, newaddedtag\\\" (add+rename+remove in one edit). Detail page showed exactly the new tag set, and search for \\\"newaddedtag\\\" returned the product.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created product assigned to category \\\"Fitness\\\" via single-select dropdown; product appeared under /category/fitness and its \\\"More in Fitness\\\" related section, and did not appear in Tech/Home categories.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On /products, selecting category \\\"Tech Gadgets\\\" from the filter reduced results to 3 tech items with accurate count; selecting \\\"All Categories\\\" restored 9/10 items.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Every product card on /products exposes name, category badge, price, star rating, brief description/review snippet, image, and a \\\"Buy Now\\\" purchase action (verified via full accessibility snapshot of all 9 seeded products).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Sort \\\"Price: Low to High\\\" produced strictly ascending price order (199..2495); \\\"Top Rated\\\" produced strictly descending rating order (4.9..4.4). Minimum-rating filter \\\"4.5+ stars\\\" correctly reduced to 8 matching items. Price-range slider (mouse click on track) correctly filtered to only products >= selected min price (e.g., min $1250 -> only Samsung/MacBook/Peloton shown).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Product additions/edits are not persisted; lost on page reload\", \"actual\": \"After creating \\\"Test Gadget XYZ\\\" via the admin panel (confirmed present in admin list and /products, 10 total), performing a hard page reload/navigation (browser back to /products via URL) reverted the product count to the original 9 and the admin product list also reverted to only the 9 seeded products - the new product and all edits were lost. State is kept only in-memory client-side with no backend/localStorage persistence.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"The admin product form's Category field is a single-select combobox restricted to exactly Tech Gadgets / Home Goods / Fitness; every product observed across list/category/detail views showed exactly one category.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Combined rating(4.5+)+price(min $1250) filter returned exactly the 3 products satisfying both criteria. Selecting tags \\\"camera\\\"+\\\"espresso\\\" together (OR logic) returned exactly the 2 products each having at least one of the selected tags (Samsung galaxy for camera, Breville for espresso).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-20\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Admin can publish incomplete products lacking required content\", \"actual\": \"Created a product with only Name and Short Description filled in (price left at $0, no image URL, no affiliate/retailer link, no specifications). The form submitted successfully with no validation error, and the product was immediately published and visible to visitors on /products (count increased to 11), despite missing image, retailer link, and specifications.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/product/does-not-exist-xyz showed \\\"Product Not Found\\\" message with a \\\"Browse All Products\\\" link and no unrelated product data. /category/nonexistent showed \\\"Category Not Found\\\" message.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Category select, sort select, min-rating select, price slider, tag toggles, and search box all updated the product grid and result count instantly without any page reload/navigation across all tests performed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking a product's image or name link on /products, a category page, or the homepage navigated to /product/{same-slug}, matching that exact product's detail page (verified for Sony, Test Gadget XYZ, Philips Hue).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking \\\"Buy Now\\\" on the Sony WH-1000XM5 detail page opened a new tab to https://example.com/sony-xm5 (product-specific external retailer URL), matching the href shown on both list and detail views.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category selector on the dedicated category page does not change category\", \"actual\": \"On /category/home, the category filter select (which is offered on that page) shows \\\"Home Goods\\\". Selecting \\\"Fitness\\\" from its dropdown does not navigate or change the displayed products/active category - the combobox snaps back to showing \\\"Home Goods\\\" and the grid still shows the 3 Home Goods products. (Note: the same select works correctly to filter category on the /products page.)\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Sony WH-1000XM5 detail page displays matching name, category (Tech), rating (4.8), price ($399), brief description, full untruncated review, 4 tags, 5 key specifications, product image, and a \\\"Buy Now\\\" retailer action - all matching the seed/list data.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Spot-checked several seeded products (Sony: headphones/wireless/noise-cancelling/premium tags under Tech; Samsung: camera/android/smartphone/flagship under Tech; Philips Hue: lighting/smart-home/ambiance/automation under Home) - all category and tag values are relevant to the product and consistent between the /products grid and the /product/{slug} detail page.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Sony WH-1000XM5 shows identical name/category/price/rating/brief description on homepage featured section, /category/tech, /products list, and detail page. Detail page's \\\"My Review\\\" paragraph shows the complete, untruncated review text and all 5 specifications, unlike any truncated preview elsewhere.\"}]}"
